            <div xml:id="d271">

                <pb facs="0393" n="283" xml:id="pg283"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/2251: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Johnson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peiping</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-10-21T15:00:00+08:00">October 21, 1931—3
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received October 21—8:43 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>802. Japanese Legation informs me that they are withdrawing their consular
                    officers and evacuating Japanese residents from Provinces of Jehol and
                    Chahar.</p>
                <closer>For the Minister:<lb/><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                        >Engert</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
